# FitSignal backend configuration
#
# SETUP:  cp .env.example .env   then fill in ONE provider key below.
#
# .env is gitignored and must never be committed. .env.example is the committed
# template — keep it free of real values.
#
# Values here OVERRIDE the surrounding shell environment (see lib/env.js).
# That is deliberate on this machine: ~/.zshrc lines 9-10 export a truncated
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY that would otherwise shadow a correct key and produce a
# confusing 401. Setting the key here is enough — you do not have to edit
# ~/.zshrc, though removing those two stale export lines is tidier.


# ─── Model provider — set exactly ONE of these ───────────────────────────────

# Anthropic (recommended — matches README.md and GCP_SCHEMA.md).
# Create a key: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# A real key starts with "sk-ant-" and is ~100+ characters. If yours is short,
# it was truncated in transit — copy it again.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OpenAI (the path the original code shipped with).
# Create a key: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# No key? If the `claude` CLI is installed and logged in on this machine
# (i.e. Claude Code itself), FitSignal falls back to it automatically —
# scores through the same account/subscription, nothing to provision here.
# See provider-claude-cli.js. Override the binary path or model with:
# CLAUDE_CLI_BIN=
# CLAUDE_CLI_MODEL=


# ─── Provider selection ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Auto-detected: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, then OPENAI_API_KEY, then a local `claude`
# CLI if one is on PATH. Override explicitly with:
#   anthropic | openai | claude-cli | mock
# "mock" runs the full pipeline offline with placeholder scores and needs no key.
# LLM_PROVIDER=


# ─── Model tuning (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5
# ANTHROPIC_MAX_TOKENS=16000        # caps thinking + response together
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini
# OPENAI_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=8000


# ─── Server (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PORT=8080
# MAX_RESUME_CHARS=200000


# ─── BigQuery persistence (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave unset to run without persistence — a failed insert is logged and the
# request still returns a scorecard.
# BIGQUERY_PROJECT=primordial-mile-502615-m2
# BIGQUERY_DATASET=fitsignal
# BIGQUERY_TABLE=resume_scores
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/absolute/path/to/service-account.json
